# Secrets and data must never enter an image layer.
#
# This is the one entry here with real consequences: a layer keeps whatever was
# copied into it even if a later step deletes the file, so `.env` (live provider
# keys) and `runs/` (real companies' email addresses and phone numbers) would
# travel with the image to anyone it is shared with.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
runs/

# Virtualenvs are host-specific and would shadow the container's own.
.venv/
**/.venv/

# Build noise
.git/
.gitignore
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.DS_Store

# Not needed at runtime. Tests are deliberately excluded: the image runs the
# service, and the suite runs on the host or in CI where the dev extra is
# installed.
tests/
**/tests/
docs/
.claude/
